(text "BASELINE TWO-ABZ DIFFERENTIAL RECEIVER - SCHEMATIC BLOCK r0.1" (at 17.78 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2.1 2.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "42d6d56d-70de-5dba-a299-fd952108b6b0"))
(text "Six receiver channels, exact ledger allocation; no encoder supply limiter, line protection, FPGA pin assignment or board release." (at 17.78 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5202f569-64a8-5d0a-b0c4-39f2ec451c1d"))
(text "Unused U2 channels 3/4:\nA tied IO_3V3; B tied LOGIC_GND.\nOutputs 11/13 deliberately NC.\nNo floating or shorted unused inputs." (at 447.04 157.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "90909b1d-9054-58be-b42c-136457623cfb"))
(text "JENC pin1/2=A+/−; 3/4=B+/−; 5/6=Z+/−; 7=protected5V; 8=logic ground.\nSupply limiters are absent: JPWR1 passes separately supplied, already protected rails.\nJLOGIC1/JPWR1 are circuit boundaries only; connector MPNs remain unselected." (at 17.78 246.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8278e050-1458-5fe5-b0a7-0ee09d10699b"))
(text "TERMINATION: fitted 120R per pair; DNP = open. Never substitute a short.\nLocation is receiver end only; encoder/cable profile must qualify the load." (at 236.22 236.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "45c060e2-03bc-56db-9351-657d819918c6"))
(text "TI SLLS849E: Fig5-1 / Table8-1 / Section10. Place C1/C3 close to U1/U2 pins16/8.\nOpen-circuit fail-safe does NOT guarantee a valid state for a shorted or terminated disconnected cable.\nNo galvanic isolation, independent cable-loss detection or measured encoder timing here." (at 17.78 368.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e60d0f1a-e036-5f0c-81dc-435abfeedcf4"))
(text "Termination reference: CRCW1210120RFKEA (1210,0.5W at70C).\nDeclared applied differential bound:5.5V; worst allowance ~0.259W/channel.\nInitial localambient<=70C; PCB/film temperature and load still require measurement.\nReceiver +/-7V common mode does not rate termination for14V differential.\nESD component ratings do not qualify the complete controller." (at 236.22 342.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "baff84a1-7d5c-53fe-92b4-4a2709688155"))
)
